{:event/actor "seb" :event/at #inst "2026-07-29T18:47:36.895Z" :event/body {:fact/path [:summary] :fact/value "store/file pack! ignores the return of (.renameTo tmp (pack-file dir)), then writes the index and deletes every loose .edn regardless. A failed rename leaves the OLD pack in place, an index describing the NEW one, and no loose files - the newly packed events are gone, and the next read fails with pack slice unreachable rather than a warning. There is also no fsync between writing the pack and deleting the originals, so a power loss in that window loses events the store reported as packed. Check the rename, force the pack to disk before any delete, and treat a failed rename as a refusal to pack rather than a partial one."} :event/parents #{"sha256-5aa56e2107571327939b30b9070f5687cdbbce0d06905f557746917c29392a68"} :event/ticket #uuid "e719a456-7475-454e-a9e3-f1248f40330d" :event/type :fact/assert}